    "visibleText": "Contact us\nMenu\nClose\n1st December Films\nINDIA'S MOST AWARDED AD FILM HOUSE\nThe one film a brand\nbuilds its year around\n/\nINTRO\n\nFirst December Films is a Mumbai based advertising film house, and one\nof the most awarded to ever come out of India. Most ads are forgotten by\nthe next break. We make the one film a brand builds its year around,\nshaped, shot and finished with the same care from the first idea to the final\ngrade.\n\n\nPremium isn't a look. It's a hundred decisions, made by people who've\nmade them before. It is why our work tends to outlast the campaign it was\nmade for. Made with brands and agencies across India and the world.\n\nWHAT WE ARE PROUD OF\nWork\n\nNo media found\n\nNo media found\n\nNo media found\n\nNo media found\n\nNo media found\n\nNo media found\n\nNo media found\n\nNo media found\n\nNo media found\n\nNo media found\n\nNo media found\n\nNo media found\n\nPro Bono - CSR\n\nNo media found\n\nNo media found\n\nNo media found\n\nNo media found\n\nNo media found\n\nNo media found\n\nExplore All Work\nINDIA'S MOST AWARDED DIRECTORS & PRODUCERS\nBrands don't hire\na company. They\nhire a point of view.\n/\nDIRECTORS\nGanesh Pareek\n\nCannes Gold and Glass Lion winning producer, counted among the world’s top TV commercial producers, and director of the feature film Manu (2023).\n\nAtul Kattukaran\n\nCannes Lions winning director (2014, 2016, 2017) and the only Indian ever named in the world’s Top 10 TVC directors by the Cannes Lions Global Creativity Report.\n\nShivang Monga\n\nDirector of the CARS24 ‘Family Promises’ campaign, the IGP festive gifting series and Cipla’s Cipcal 500 film.\n\nAll Directors\nMORE THAN 150 INTERNATIONAL AWARDS\nThe Record\nAWARD\nAWARDING BODY\nYEAR\nStar Sports: Chora Chori | ABBY Awards 2026 (Gold)\nABBY Awards\n\n2026\n\nMeta: Cap Ka Suroor (Himesh) | Good Ads Matter Awards 2025 (Gold)\nGood Ads Matter Awards\n\n2025\n\nVivo: X300 Pro | Good Ads Matter Awards 2025 (Bronze)\nGood Ads Matter Awards\n\n2025\n\nNike Cricket: Make Every Yard Count | Cannes Lions 2014-15 (Lion)\nCannes Lions\n\n2014\n\nBeauty Tips by Reshma: Cannes Lions 2016 (Gold Lion)\nCannes Lions\n\n2016\n\nGoogle: Search Something New | Kyoorius Creative Awards 2024 (Baby Blue Elephant)\nKyoorius Creative Awards\n\n2024\n\nMeta: Cap Ka Suroor (Himesh) | Kyoorius Creative Awards 2026 (Blue Elephant)\nKyoorius Creative Awards\n\n2026\n\nMeta: Cap Ka Suroor (Himesh) | Kyoorius Creative Awards 2026 (Blue Elephant) #2\nKyoorius Creative Awards\n\n2026\n\nStar Sports: Women's Chora Chori | Kyoorius Creative Awards 2026 (Baby Blue Elephant)\nKyoorius Creative Awards\n\n2026\n\nIGP: Amazing Gifts, Samay Par | IMPACT Ads 2024 (Hall of Fame)\nIMPACT Ads Hall of Fame\n\n2024\n\nNike Cricket: Make Every Yard Count | The One Show 2014-15 (Gold Pencil)\nThe One Show\n\n2014\n\nAll Awards & Recognition\nINDIA'S MOST RECOGNIZED ADS FILMS PRODUCTION HOUSE\nAs Featured In\nAll Media and Press Releases\nINDIA'S MOST AWARDED ADS FILMS VIDEO PRODUCTION STUDIO\nFESTIVAL / SHOW\nAll Festivals / Shows\nMORE THAN 100+ BRANDS\nIn Good Company\nAll Brands\nPaste the script.\nSee how we would make it.\n\nA producer's read in about a minute: the beats, the runtime,\nhow it would be shot, and two directors from our roster.\n\nAnalyse your script\n\n( Pages )\n\nHome\nWork\nDirectors\nAI Ad Films\nAwards\nBTS\n\n( Quick Links)\n\nAbout\nBlogs & Insights\nPress & Media\nCareers\nScript Analyzer\n\n( Socials)\n\nYoutube\nInstagram\nVimeo\nLinkedIn\nX\n\n( Contact)\n\nmail@1stdecember.com\n+91 9619474323 - Imran\n+91 8425065389 - Ankit\nContact us\nNot your typical film production house\n© 2026 First December Films. All Rights Reserved.\nPrivacy Policy\nTerms & Conditions\nSitemap\nMade in India by Webyansh\nAsk Ganesh",
